Subject: Select native static texture manager lifecycle

Upstream-base: 2c5c51e483b652d178ef06a44b83b07a0f97d2a6

Select native static texture manager lifecycle
Select original static texture lookup, binding resolution, registration and
PlatTexture linear-buffer release without linking unadapted loaders or texture
animation. Preserve the queue algorithm, checking capacity, index and ownership
before access. Reclaim constructor failures and add ordered shutdown. Insert
inventory nodes before consuming a free index, so failed insertion is atomic.
Select glTextureManagerStatic.cpp alone for this native subset. Texture GPU
objects are not reinterpreted as Aurora objects; native GX upload is external.

